心底楽しそうに家事に勤しむ姿は、まさに夢想。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふふっ、……あ、チカくん寝癖ついてるよ？　ちょっとしゃがんでくれる？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21192"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47768b4a23be1567f168892075f22c20c0c08136597d93e88b0fb04cffc040aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8412fcb304e8b915b98bd30a563e69afe60890dcba9c2b6331a889d12f7f5c7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:71437:21192:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17067","characterName":"枝那森 千里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21193","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"71437"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1491"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17067"},"originalCharacterName":"枝那森 千里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"103"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"...No matter what happens, I'll be happy to just stay by your side.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only member of the Handicraft Club who has been around for a year already. She is quiet but whenever Senri talks, she says everything very straightly, almost even bluntly. She is honest about her feelings for Haruchika as well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17067"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"春近を除けば、唯一の昨年からの手芸部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで、口を開けば端的かつストレートな表現をし、おとなしい子かと思いきや、存外のんきでマイペース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか時に大胆な行動や発言も飛び出し、周囲を驚かせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも同じ位置で黙々と編み物をしていて、周りで何が起きようが我関せずと動じない――ように見えるだけで、実は常に春近を気に掛けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その澄んだ瞳にじっと見つめられると、何故か不必要な罪悪感がこみ上げるとか。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1491","sourceWorkId":"18939","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"春近を除けば、唯一の昨年からの手芸部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで、口を開けば端的かつストレートな表現をし、おとなしい子かと思いきや、存外のんきでマイペース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか時に大胆な行動や発言も飛び出し、周囲を驚かせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも同じ位置で黙々と編み物をしていて、周りで何が起きようが我関せずと動じない――ように見えるだけで、実は常に春近を気に掛けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その澄んだ瞳にじっと見つめられると、何故か不必要な罪悪感がこみ上げるとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……私はどんなことでも春近と一緒なら嬉しいわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21193"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/377f3e99f99beb9fb1df1ca72ec2d4a772aad9277873ad5d2cd4054141d0241f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d9671609f7e780dc305a0852ce78eaead086bb31cde6c9eae368316e7f2aa81.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:71437:21193:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17068","characterName":"つぎゅ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21194","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"71437"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1492"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17068"},"originalChar